  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.29 - Harden AM003 custom collection fixer safety\n\n            Changed:\n            - Hardened AM003 so unsupported custom collection destination types keep only the manual-review ignore action instead of speculative constructor rewrites that may not compile\n            - Preserved safe AM003 automatic conversions for known BCL collection destinations while keeping the manual-review ignore action available alongside those rewrites\n\n            Validation:\n            - Full solution test suite passing on net10.0 with targeted AM003 code-fix coverage\n            - Rule catalog and sample diagnostics snapshot checks passing\n            - Codex review passing\n            - git diff --check clean\n\n            Previous Release: v2.30.28 - Tighten fixer actions to avoid unsafe automatic rewrites",
